  <releases>
    <release version="4.9.0" date="2026-09-05" type="stable">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>Importers for long coverage tags, Markdown, and reStructuredText now collect the location of coverage IDs in documents and source code.</li>
          <li>Item ID locations enable IDE features including syntax highlighting, finding occurrences, jumping to definitions, and auto-completion.</li>
          <li>Deprecated the ImportEventListener methods setId, addCoveredId, and addDependsOnId.</li>
          <li>Collect source-code locations for specification item IDs.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
